Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 01:44:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1130/1265] The instruments' sheet for the public; the About
 card's logo and our Hugging Face repos (1166, part ten)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «нужно все заметки-шпаргалки на английском на все наши пробы, всё, что идёт в
паблик… Мои вердикты в читшите музыкальном делай на английском»; «К сожалению, oboe нет в YuE2»;
«В Engine логотип заменить. Все наши восходящие HF репозитории добавь в колонку Ruach Studio,
через пустую строку. Это наша колонка».

- The sheet (its DATA from heresy/tools/instruments_src.py): the fifteen palette probes his ear
  approved (the grand piano by its lid, the helmet and table gusli, kantele, the kinnor of King
  David, nevel, kithara, the lyre of Ur, plucked and bowed psaltery, the Alpine concert zither,
  cimbalom, gudok) get rows of their own, heard; his verdicts all in English (the shofar's, the
  gong's, the cicadas' words); the oboe failed. 200 instruments · 159 heard · 6 questioned ·
  35 not identified.
- The About card: the bar's own logo, its words in the page's language (a copy heresy-i18n.js
  paints again with the words, its gradients' ids its own), the tagline under it; under Ruach
  Studio, a line's space below its credits, ours on Hugging Face: Model weights, LoRAs, Starter
  sets, Instrument probes (the bucket, public; the others private until the release).
- "Instrument probes" in the six catalogs (2,430 keys each).

Checked in the page: the copy 222×64 in Russian, its fills on its own gradients; the four links
after 20 px; the sheet finds every renamed probe (353 ▶ with a take). cdp-console 316/0/7,
check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
